  "body": "A rare coastal THAB landholding in tightly held Rothesay Bay, offering scale, elevation, sea views and multiple development pathways.\r\n\r\nComprising 16, 18 & 20 Browns Bay Road, this approximately 3,233sqm landholding provides developers, builders and land bankers with the flexibility to acquire, stage, optimise or redesign around a substantial planning foundation already in place.\r\n\r\nFor purchasers seeking a larger platform, 22 & 24 Beechwood Road may also be considered, creating a combined landholding of approximately 5,257sqm with Resource Consent and Building Consent already obtained for a 35-townhouse scheme.\r\n\r\n* Approx. 3,233sqm freehold landholding\r\n* Residential - Terrace Housing and Apartment Building Zone\r\n* Elevated north-facing position with sea outlook\r\n* Approx. 68.3m frontage to Browns Bay Road\r\n* Premium school zoning and strong end-buyer appeal\r\n* Ability to acquire separately or combine with 22 & 24 Beechwood Road\r\n* Existing RC/BC platform across the broader five-site scheme\r\n* Suitable for developers seeking flexibility rather than a fixed one-size-fits-all project\r\n\r\nContact Ray 022 158 3320 today for a comprehensive information pack or to arrange a private site inspection.",
